  "body": "In https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/issues/1385 we discovered some specification UB. However, that also raised the question as to whether this method should perhaps be throwing an exception when given a detached buffer.\r\n\r\nI tend to think it should and hopefully there's no callers relying on it not throwing as it's still early days?\r\n\r\ncc @hsivonen @inexorabletash @youennf",
